[[576,7,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the compressor\nengagement circuit.</p><p>The relay receives a supply from the line\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT/A) for the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are housed in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The coil receives a supply controlled by\nthe ignition (15/54) from the line from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B25</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99\nor from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from\n2/99; the relay is thus energized by an earth signal coming from\nthe engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : in this way the air\nconditioning compressor L20 engagement electromagnet is operated\nthrougha voltage of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>12 V</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"],[512,7,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The engagement of the compressor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nalso controlled by means of a special thermal contact \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I60</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nintervenes if the temperature is too high.</p>"],[576,7,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The climate control control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n7 of connector A) sends the signal for enabling the engagement of\nthe compressor to the 4 stage pressure switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; if the\npressures in the circuit are correct, the signal leaves the pressure switch\nand reaches the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . (pin 3 of connector\nB).</p><p>According to its own internal control logic,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the command to engage the compressor\n(from pin 33  of connector D) which energizes the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]